	(property "Description" "DAOKAI/CJMCU-3221 INA3221 3-channel monitor, 38.0 x 31.8mm, three 0.1Ω (R100) shunts. Pads 1-8 = header VS GND SCL SDA PV CRI WAR TC, 2.54mm, pad 1 square at the right end; pad 2 is also on the two large GND holes (same net); pad 15 = large hole VPU; pads 9-14 = channel holes VIN1- VIN1+ VIN2- VIN2+ VIN3- VIN3+, 5.08mm within a pair. A0 is set by 4 solder-bridge pads at the left edge, not on the header. Positions scaled from the owner's photos, about 0.3mm; check with a caliper before ordering a PCB."
		(at 0 0 0)
		(unlocked yes)
		(layer "F.Fab")
